      },
      "message": "feat(tools,ui): built-in BT30/BT40/CAT40 holder library (ER and Weldon)\n\nA built-in holder library (camcraft-tools::holder_library): BT30 and\nBT40 (JIS B 6339 / MAS 403) and CAT40 (ASME B5.50) tapers, each as an\nER collet chuck (ER16-ER32; ISO 15488 / DIN 6499) or a Weldon side-lock\nholder (DIN 1835 B / DIN 6359 bores), drawn as spun profiles: nut or\nbody, flange as a full cylinder, standoff, closed at the gauge line.\n\nSetToolBody::library drops an entry into a tool's holder as one\nundoable command over SetToolBody::spun (gauge length and projection\nadjustable), so it lands editable and is judged by the existing body\npath. The tool editor's Profile tab gets a Library holder picker with a\ngauge length field and Apply holder. Dimensions and the small-BT\ndecision are recorded in docs/decisions/793-taper-holders.md; the MCP\ntool is #799.\n\nFixes #793\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
